- `POST /api/sso/v1/user/{uuid}/roles/beta` own UUID → 204 and roles became `["Beta - EdgeRouter","Beta - airCRM","Beta - airFiber","Beta - mFi","Beta Testers","Beta-RocketAC"]`; random UUID → 403 `mismatching UUID` (UUID-match enforced).
- `PUT /user/self` baseline `{"first_name":"Qa"}` → 204 (persisted); `PATCH` → 405 `METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED`; mass-assignment `is_admin`/`is_staff`/`roles`/`permissions`/`is_superuser`/`email_verified` ignored; `is_verified:false`/`twofa_enabled:false` NOT yet validated due to 429.
