- Community session is authenticated via SSO (page 2 shows profile menu, "+ New Post"); Settings page only notification prefs, no profile bio editor found.
- Reflection probes on blog/careers/training/status/ui.com/community: no unencoded reflection; community only URL-encodes query into `og:url` meta.
