- UISP: `main.ca315773.js` 3,816,793 B sha256 `a88cae36...`; OAuth client_id `TurNkwGPGqMdFSKxbAx68k3sPI3TJviJpqDG0Sw9`, redirect_uri `https://uisp.ui.com/`, PKCE S256. `GET https://sso.ui.com/oauth2/authorize` with valid redirect_uri + `UBIC_AUTH` → 302 `https://uisp.ui.com/?code=...`; 13 redirect_uri bypass variants all 400 (exact-match). Potential open redirect via UISP `returnUrl` param (`window.location.href` after `isURL` check) — unconfirmed, low/medium.
- account.svc.ui.com: `/zendesk/user` 200 own Zendesk user (id `44629467972247`); `/zendesk/tickets`, `/tickets/closed` 200 empty own; `/chat/messaging/jwt` 404; `/zendesk/comments/1` and `/zendesk/comments/999999999999` both 404 (`Requested resource could not be found`) — no IDOR confirmable without own ticket.
