- Account A (verified): `qacct1a6967` / `uitest1ad6967@maxxspace.com` / `Tx!11703594536aec8d9aA`; SSO UUID `314f82e1-8e68-488a-ad94-96e1c252990b`; `UBIC_AUTH` in `result/accounts/accountA-cookies.json`; mail.tm token in `result/creds/test-accounts.txt`.
