- Google Maps key `AIzaSyBE3JpOF9gNSsb83dpZKLUqFkmBAsPr0-w` referer-restricted — NOT a finding. Stripe `pk_live_*` public by design.
- Safety: test-owned data only; no destructive/high-volume/brute-force/DoS; respect rate limits; no CAPTCHA solving.
- Source maps unavailable (SPA HTML / 406).
- `git status` shows pre-existing deletions/modifications and many untracked dirs; do not commit or revert unrelated files.

